' Party cycling in a place names the one chosen over his head, in his
' colour, with his marks, for 1.5 s and fading over the last 0.35 s
' (`AnnounceCharacter`, LocationScene.cs:34,718;
' MapViewOverlayNearbyAction.cs:72-78,135-140,312-326) — not at the view's
' centre. Run with `preset classic ai none seed 3 start 30 party` (the
' leader and one companion handed over, a prepared state; the companion
' has no name of his own, so his announcement is empty).
press escape             ' Back closes the manual v1.2 opens on a new game's first world map (MapScene.cs:687-691)
mapclick 110,122         ' into Paradise Camp
wait 60
press shift+right        ' the companion, alone
wait 70                  ' past 1.5 s: gone
snap announce_gone
press shift+right        ' the leader, alone: "Gregory" over his head
wait 2
snap announce_leader
quit
